        "content": "type: search_result\ntitle: \"Quicken Simplifi App: Reach money goals the smart & easy way | Quicken\"\nurl: \"https://www.quicken.com/products/simplifi/\"\ndescription: \"Track & categorize spending, save more money, create budgets, get insights with reports, manage investments & plan for retirement—all in one intuitive app.\"\nage: null\npage_age: null\nlanguage: en\nfamily_friendly: true\nprofile_name: Quicken\nmeta_url_favicon: \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/Zi4korWKPsBJh-ZoRMFOkXlXp8HdvkS2YEL8J_A1cLA/rs:fit:32:32:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cDovL2Zhdmlj/b25zLnNlYXJjaC5i/cmF2ZS5jb20vaWNv/bnMvYjY1ZGE5MzFj/YTNjMGQxZjZmZTlk/NDI3MTIwM2ZmZDEx/ZDc0NzY3NDUxYjQ5/YTA4ZGExMDFlNzhm/ZDUzMDgxZC93d3cu/cXVpY2tlbi5jb20v\"\nthumbnail_src: \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/ENTlgMZPPEkHTnFAdVSbWf4Q2TEP0UUIRlhIoUsrjxA/rs:fit:200:200:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFn/ZXMuY3RmYXNzZXRz/Lm5ldC9oZnhpdHRr/Y203NncvNlRLSE1W/YVM2YWZvMXFxSHdr/eGhLby8zNjEzNzVi/NDdkOGFlZjFhZGQw/NjMxNTFhNGQ0YmE1/ZC9zaW1wbGlmaS1n/b29nbGUtc2hvcHBp/bmcucG5n\"\nthumbnail_original: \"https://images.ctfassets.net/hfxittkcm76w/6TKHMVaS6afo1qqHwkxhKo/361375b47d8aef1add063151a4d4ba5d/simplifi-google-shopping.png\"\nextra_snippets: \"Quicken’s connectivity is second-to-none, helping you get your finances fully and completely integrated into your account for the most accurate picture. ... Keep tabs on where (and how) you’re spending, automatically categorize all your transactions, and easily identify any spending issues. Adjust as necessary and keep your budget on track.|Get an automatic, fully customizable spending plan. Reach your savings goals. Plan for the future with projected cash flows. No matter where you are on your personal finance journey, Quicken Simplifi has you covered. How is Quicken Simplifi’s Spending Plan different from other budgets?|Easily ignore any spending that you don't want to count toward your monthly budget ... Yep! You can share your Quicken Simplifi account with your partner, financial advisor, or anyone you trust.|Instead, it starts with your monthly income, subtracts your bills & subscriptions, and generates a personalized Spending Plan that adjusts automatically as you spend. No matter how you like to budget, the tools in Quicken Simplifi can accommodate any method you like to use — zero-based budgeting, envelope budgeting, 50-30-20, and more.\"\nhash: 6a30a532bc608538\nembed_ref: quicken.com-3Q0\napp_id: web\nskill_id: search",
